{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據圖10所提供的資訊，由甲處向四周觀察可看到的地景為何？", "options": {"A": "由甲處向西北可遠眺瑪西分校", "B": "高速公路沿著河階修建", "C": "圖中東南山坡有蔗田拾級而上", "D": "大埔交流道於陡坡修建\n- 3 -\n99年指考 第 4 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "15-17", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 50.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 67.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 58.0, 50.0, 41.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "1960年代台灣設置加工出口區的區位選擇傾向鄰近國際港埠，空間上高度聚集，以利\n產品輸出。就此區位條件而言，下列何地被選定為設置加工出口專業區？", "options": {"A": "雲林", "B": "高雄", "C": "屏東", "D": "新竹"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "18-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 93.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 85.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 93.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 85.0, "discrimination": 13.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 97.0, 95.0, 93.0, 81.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "台灣有些位於都市近郊的老舊工業區若要轉型為大賣場、購物中心等使用目標，首要\n之務應是：", "options": {"A": "加強水電、排水系統等公共建設", "B": "發展衛星市鎮，創造消費需求", "C": "解編工業區，進行土地使用分區重劃", "D": "發展大眾捷運系統，改善區位條件"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "18-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 37.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [63.0, 50.0, 45.0, 40.0, 34.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "最近幾年部分台商因為產業發展環境的變化而出現回流的現象。下列哪些因素是造成\n台商回流的主要原因？\n甲、中國出口退稅調降 乙、台幣匯率持續下貶\n丙、國外市場需求擴大 丁、台灣土地租金優惠", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "乙丙", "C": "丙丁", "D": "甲丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "18-20", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 45.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 37.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 44.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 48.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 42.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 22.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 42.0, 37.0, 33.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「多元族群特色、優美山河景觀、潔淨土地資源、平疇綠野稻香」\n丙丙丙丙\n是圖11中哪個軸帶發展上所具有的優勢條件？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 0.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 96.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 1.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 71.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 93.0, 88.0, 81.0, 65.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「西部創新發展軸」共分為北部、中部與南部三大城市區域。\n目前此三大城市區域在發展上具有下列哪些共同特徵？\n甲、已闢建科學工業園區 乙、已營運的高運量捷運系統\n丙、三百萬以上人口的直轄市 丁、有對外聯絡的機場和港口\n圖11", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "乙丙", "C": "丙丁", "D": "甲丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 66.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 55.0, 46.0, 37.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「離島生態觀光區」以提供國民特殊生態與文化體驗為\n主，發展上強調環境保育和文化保存。圖12為台灣某處\n島嶼上的地景，屬於重要的保育資源。此離島是：", "options": {"A": "金門", "B": "馬祖", "C": "澎湖", "D": "蘭嶼"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 89.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 74.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 89.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 97.0, 94.0, 88.0, 66.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "發生震災的海地位於圖13中何處？ 甲甲甲甲", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁 乙乙乙乙 丙丙丙丙 丁丁丁丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "24-25", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 46.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 21.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 27.0, "p_value": 28.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 14.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 34.0, 25.0, 18.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "此次地震災情慘重的主要原因是：", "options": {"A": "震央距人口密集區近", "B": "引發土石流掩埋村莊", "C": "海嘯襲擊沿海低地區", "D": "地震後適逢颶風來襲\n圖13\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 99年指考\n共 7 頁 地理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "24-25", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 81.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 93.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 66.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 66.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 89.0, 84.0, 76.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "亞洲金融風暴受創國在風暴前的「實體經濟的失衡」是指：", "options": {"A": "推動大規模的建設計畫，積壓大量資金", "B": "發展龐大的重化工業，資金短期難以回收", "C": "執行進口替代政策，生產效率低落，產品銷售欠佳", "D": "產業高度擴張，致產能過剩，經濟成長趨緩，貿易逆差擴大"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "26-28", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 23.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 56.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 45.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 56.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 11.0, "p_quintiles": [56.0, 54.0, 53.0, 50.0, 42.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "亞洲金融風暴受創國在風暴前的「虛擬經濟的失衡」是指：", "options": {"A": "房地產信貸管制鬆散，大量資金放貸給信用評等很低的購屋者", "B": "國際熱錢不斷流入，房地產、股市等資產價值膨脹，匯率抬升", "C": "金融產業以高利率吸引國際資金，進行高風險金融商品的投資", "D": "發行國債以支持國營產業，因無力償還本息，致主權信用動搖"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "26-28", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 28.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 46.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 80.0, 71.0, 59.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考99-geography-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 99, "year_ce": 2010, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "歐洲某國在2000年後，朝向成為「境外金融中心」發展，以高息、低稅率吸引國際資\n金，大多運用於高倍數的風險性金融投資，使該國在短短幾年間人均國民所得躍居世\n界第四位。但2008年底，國際資金枯竭，各項金融投資大幅虧損，無力償還國際存戶\n的本息。此國應是下列哪國？", "options": {"A": "冰島", "B": "希臘", "C": "英國", "D": "愛爾蘭"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "26-28", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 84.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 91.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 73.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 89.0, 86.0, 83.0, 68.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
